es to store.sweep_orphans, already 100% in chunkstore — a clock-injection seam would be test-only complexity on a non-critical path); delete:625 `!=`->`==` (log-only warning on a mirror-removal failure); safe_rel_path:47:47 `||`->`&&` (EQUIVALENT on Windows — the component-split + segs.join()==path backstop already rejects a backslash, so the early guard is redundant there; the new test kills it on a POSIX FS where '\\' is literal). Green: cargo test --lib vault::tests 42 passed (37 prior + 5 new). Resolves issueVaultRequestPathTestGaps."; }
