        action critiqueRPlus1ServerHardening;
        verification critiqueRPlus1ServerHardeningDoD : Test { :>> id = "c1a7d0e1-4b5c-4d6e-8f70-1a2b3c4d5e68"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::test; :>> procedureText = "Fixed the six verified server-side findings from the critique R+1 pass, each with a fail-first regression; server cargo test --locked green (203 tests) + clippy --all-targets -D warnings clean. (1) issueFoldBackfillAsciiOnly — index_store.migrate now backfills fold per-row in Rust to_lowercase() (was SQLite ASCII-only lower(), which left legacy non-ASCII rows escaping colliding_key); test migrate_backfills_non_ascii_fold_so_the_collision_guard_still_fires. (2) issueShareLinkRemanence — added ShareLinkStore::purge_vault/purge_user + an open-time expiry sweep, wired into state.purge_vault + admin.users_delete, so a no-expiry link can't survive a delete+recreate (mirror of the R17 grant purge); tests purge_vault_and_user_drop_links + open_sweeps_expired_unredeemed_links. (3) issueVaultDeleteOpenRace — a deleted_vaults tombstone set: purge_vault holds the per-key open lock + tombstones the key, vault() refuses a tombstoned key (NotFound) instead of create_dir_all resurrecting it, create_vault clears it; test purged_vault_is_not_auto_recreated_by_a_raced_open. (4) issuePurgeDirNotBestEffort — purge_vault/purge_user_data dir removal is now log-not-propagate (no grants-purged half-state 500 on a Windows lock), and users_delete purges shares+links+admin BEFORE removing the row (SEC-3 ordering). (5) issueMfaDisableNoThrottle — /api/mfa/disable now routes the code check through login_throttle (per-account); test disable_is_brute_force_throttled (10 wrong → 401, then 429). (6) issueVersionEpochRewind — a monotonic fsync'd .version-hwm sidecar survives an index quarantine; Vault::open seeds version = max(index, hwm), commit/delete/reindex persist it, so the counter never rewinds below a synced client's cursor; test version_does_not_rewind_below_the_high_water_after_a_quarantine_rebuild. Resolves all six issues."; }
