e enum + the total transition table from (a)); D2 doReconcileAll scan-mode (4 booleans → a pure decideReconcileMode()→noop|delta|delta+config|full); D3 config-path adjudication (array-membership-as-state → an explicit per-path status). Model = decide()'s pure enumerated table. Each with tests. Resolves issueStateMachineOrphanedAndImplicit + issueVaultLifecycleImplicitFsm."; }
