        verification sittingReview20260801 : Test { :>> id = "625e9b3a-efbc-499c-9449-108fb07cab13"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::confirmation; :>> procedureText = "Per-sitting human review (D0049) for the 2026-08-01 sitting. The owner asked for a critique pass; shown 3 verified HIGH findings + the Medium/Low backlog, the owner directed 'fix all 3 HIGHs now'. This gate covers the three fixes shipped in PATCH 1.11.1 — hotLoadPrivacyGateFreshCheck (hot-load RCE-gate bypass), reconcilePathReloginOnce (mid-session token-expiry false block), vaultKeyServerQualified (server-blind vault key) — plus the decision to backlog the lower-severity findings. The owner asked for an independent RE-VERIFICATION ('you check again please') and gave a PROVISIONAL acceptance ('I'll ok it for now'), explicitly to be revisited after their own hands-on device check. The re-verification was clean: fresh client vitest 531 pass; release 1.11.1 built from the fix commit 98a44a3 (workflow success, main.js published); all three fixes present + correct in committed source; keel validate + guard ALL PASS. R1 records that PROVISIONAL owner acceptance — NOT a hands-on device sign-off (which the owner has not yet done)."; }
