        // ===== Sprint connectPhaseVisibility (2026-08-02) — 1.12.0: surface the connect sub-phases + timed
        // log so 'Connecting…' stops reading as hung (owner-reported L-5). =====
        action connectPhaseVisibility;
        verification connectPhaseVisibilityDoD : Test { :>> id = "1a6b3c80-5d4e-4f92-b7a1-0c8e29f45d63"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::test; :>> procedureText = "Ships MINOR 1.12.0 (new user-facing capability; client-only, NO server redeploy). Owner-reported (field): the status hung on 'connecting' with no insight — the log showed a 36s gap between 'connecting to ...' and 'config sync on — syncing 38 files'. doConnect runs THREE phases all labeled 'Connecting…' with no logging between them: establishSession (token -> status() 30s-timeout round-trip -> version -> refreshShareGrant), reconcileAll (fetch the full remote manifest via changes(0) THEN list+hash every local file — so the 36s of silence was establishSession + the manifest fetch, before the local scan started), finishConnect (WS + poll). FIX: a reconcile onStage hook (ReconcileDeps.onStage) fires the coarse sub-phases (fetching changes from the server -> scanning local files -> reconciling N local files); doConnect + establishSession add the earlier stages (signing in / checking the server / checking your access) and a 'finishing up'; a connect-gated setConnectStage names the current sub-phase as the 'Connecting…' DETAIL (paintLight's tip + the settings card, label stays the pure FSM projection) AND logs each with cumulative elapsed. Gated on a `connecting` flag so a poll/remote reconcile (which also fires onStage) never logs or paints a stage. So the next connect shows WHERE it is + times each phase, locating a stall instead of an opaque 'Connecting…'. Guards (fail-first): reconcile.test 'fires onStage in order: fetching changes -> scanning local files -> reconciling N' + 'no-op when onStage is not wired'; plugin-wiring 'surfaces the live connect sub-phase as the Connecting… detail, cleared after connect'. DoD: full client vitest (555) + tsc clean + esbuild build clean + keel validate/guard green. Resolves issueConnectStatusOpaque. Realizes SR-25 for the connect feedback loop (STPA S-19)."; }
        part connectPhaseVisibilityDoDR1 : TestResult { :>> id = "2b7c4d91-6e5f-40a3-c8b2-1d9e30056e74"; :>> outcome = VerdictKind::pass; :>> judgedAgainst = "34db694"; :>> judgedAt = "2026-08-02"; :>> judgedBy = "claudeOpus"; }
