        #Covers dependency from sittingReview20260803a to collapseChevronFix;
        // ===== 1.15.0 — settings tab revamp (owner-directed, mockup-approved). =====
        action settingsRevamp;
        verification settingsRevampDoD : Test { :>> id = "a1b2c3d4-1500-4a10-9b20-d1500c0de011"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::test; :>> procedureText = "Ships MINOR 1.15.0 (UX; client-only, NO server redeploy). Owner-directed settings-tab redesign, previewed as an HTML mockup and approved before implementation. Same features, reorganized: (1) a live STATUS hero leads (dot + state + last-synced; Reconnect only when down; still a pure FSM projection, fillStatus refreshes just that row); (2) CONNECTION facts (server/account/vault) + a 'Sync a device' row — the old section-and-row 'Connection' name collision gone; (3) 'Obsidian configuration' -> 'What syncs'; (4) Advanced + Timestamp-changes collapsed by default. LABELS (owner): 'Reconfigure' -> 'Setup' on the Server row next to 'Disconnect'; 'Add a device' -> 'Sync a device'; per-plugin 'Use synced' -> 'Use server's' (name which side WINS), standardized across the config-direction + config-conflict modals ('the server's version'). GLYPHS: every Connection/status action button gains a leading native lucide icon (iconBtn helper; settings/unplug/key/log-out/share-2/arrow-left-right/link/refresh-cw), Sign out red-tinted. Guards: full client vitest (585) incl. settings-ui.dom + configdir.dom + modals-ui.dom (controls found by label; icon spans carry no text) + tsc + esbuild build clean + keel validate/guard green. Nothing removed — same code paths."; }
